Nacre Wallet is an independent fork of Pearl Wallet by Kaspador and contributors.
Upstream: https://github.com/kaspador/pearl-extension
Baseline commit: c916752d09eb729de188efdd37ac64e2e26e27d6 (Pearl Wallet 1.3.2).

