Nacre additions and branding are independent of Pearl Research Labs and the
upstream Pearl Wallet project. Nacre is not affiliated with those projects.
Dependency and font notices are included in packaged release builds.

Nacre Wallet signs native Pearl (PRL) transactions on the user's device.
The nacre.finance bridge is a separate service and is not included in this
repository. Connecting to that site does not authorize automatic payments;
each website-requested PRL transfer requires explicit wallet approval.
